19:46:00 [440e] - direct food origin: Ask direct source-origin relationships. e.g. Does milk come from cows?
19:46:00 [440e] - object function: Ask what familiar objects are used for in daily routines. e.g. Do we sleep in beds?
19:46:00 [440e] - familiar event script: Ask about common actions, objects, people, or places in familiar events. e.g. Do books go in backpacks?
19:46:00 [440e] - event sequence and planning: Ask whether an action happens before, after, or to prepare for a familiar event. e.g. Do we pack before school?
